        {
          "text": "**Styling Dataview Outputs:** An exploration of using CSS snippets to customize the appearance of your Dataview tables and lists to better integrate them into your notes and dashboards.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 107,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-dataview--🆔20251018204006.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Performance and Optimization:** A look into how Dataview indexes your vault and the best practices for writing efficient queries to ensure your vault remains fast as it grows.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 109,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-dataview--🆔20251018204006.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The `dataview-api`:** An investigation into the plugin's underlying API, which is used by DataviewJS and other plugins (like Dataview-Charts) to access the Dataview index.",
