          "line_number": 110,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-dataview--🆔20251018204006.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Dataview `Views`:** A study of the (newer) \"Views\" feature, which allows you to define reusable query components using JavaScript and markdown, promoting a more modular approach to dashboard building.",
